Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Specifically 먹는 the boring dance–
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,76...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.27,0:00:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.83,0:00:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.75,0:00:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,BUYON!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yuih!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:08.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough man-eating\Ngiants for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.35,0:01:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if everyone's\Nhaving as much fun as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this tunnel ever end?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It might, but only when Noah wants it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You mustn't forget, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.51,0:01:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's controlling everything around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah can try to stop us if he wants\Nto, but we're gonna find our friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep running, Yugi, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.85,0:01:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting absolutely\Nnowhere very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.15,0:01:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But not to worry, my good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.67,0:01:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a destination in mind for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.53,0:01:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, you won't be\Nanywhere near your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.99,0:01:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.31,0:02:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Noah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak to me, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to volunteer to duel the next\Nvictim and make up for Gansley's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.49,0:02:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't fail me, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already chosen your dueling opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and it shouldn't be too\Ndifficult for you to defeat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.31,0:02:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.81,0:02:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This easily wins the prize\Nfor the worst day ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I need a nap, just a small one,\Nso I can get my energy back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a dream that we were\Ntrapped in a virtual world,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.59,0:02:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,and we had to duel these\Nfive old guys to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Taya, this is the dream, and when you\Nwake up, you'll need this card. I will?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.71,0:02:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, it's the Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.03,0:02:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.95,0:02:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a Broadway play about this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw it a few years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We did?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not really, but this is\Nyour dream, so just go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,\Nthe Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.97,0:03:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.21,0:03:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,the most powerful being ever to\Nstep foot on a Broadway stage will
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.81,0:03:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,choose a volunteer from the audience\Nto join her in her first number.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.95,0:03:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Give our volunteer a\Nbig round of applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.31,0:03:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was seeing things, but\NI really was rescued by a penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.19,0:03:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for getting me out of that cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm supposed to follow you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.39,0:04:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I thought things\Ncouldn't get any weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.79,0:04:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more of you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do I have to lose? Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.63,0:04:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.01,0:04:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm talking to penguins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.09,0:04:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Penguin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, could you squawk twice\Nif we're almost there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you have got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.07,0:04:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the possible\Nplaces I could have gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to end up on a raft\Nride to a virtual Antarctica
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Or worse, planet of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:05:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Penguins, hi there, I come in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,peace take me to your leader
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,if I'm gonna climb 2,000
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,stairs there better be someone\Nup there who speaks English
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.01,0:05:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, is anyone in there? Of course.\NOpen your eyes and look around with ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're surrounded by my penguin army.\NI know I meant is there anyone in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.33,0:05:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Without feathers and a beak, there's no\None here but us penguins. Taya, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My name? I know more than that. Taya\NGardner, five foot five, size six sneaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got all the numbers in\Nmy report and I'd say your
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,number is up because I'm\Nabout to put the freeze on you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.67,0:05:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you and what do\Nyou want from me anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,don't tell me you forgot\Nour last meeting I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Think I'd remember you\Nlook things are never what
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.31,0:06:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,they appear to be here\Nso when we met earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked a bit different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.50,0:06:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the big five!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.57,0:06:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Crump, former\Naccountant of Kaivacorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.09,0:06:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Disguised as a penguin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and I'll explain all that soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But for starters, let's do a\Nquick run through your numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my notes, there's a 100\N% chance that we're going to duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Me versus you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Winner gets to leave this world,\Nloser is trapped here forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.13,0:06:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's get\Nback to my calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.43,0:06:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Says here you've dueled\Nfive times in your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,which gives you a 1 % chance\Nof actually winning this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.49,0:06:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It also says you've eaten\N216 slices of pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how do you know all this\Nstuff about me, birdbrain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Collecting facts and figures is my job,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'd be surprised what numbers\Ntell you about a person's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Crump, my life is\Nnone of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have to disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.69,0:07:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, when I win this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.73,0:07:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be ready to become you no way my\Npartners and I no longer have our own bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.84,0:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that's why I've taken the form\Nof a giant virtual penguin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and come here to live with my\Npenguin brothers and sisters
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.63,0:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stay here? 'Cuz\NI need the real world. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and once I completely out-duel\Nyou here in my very own palace of
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,ice I can finally return to the\Nworld disguised as you listen to me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Flipper feet? I've had enough of\Nthis, so I'm out of here. We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,about that you can try and run away
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.59,0:07:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, but the odds are against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.73,0:07:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my iceberg dueling\Nfield is about to leave you cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Before we start, we'll have to choose our\Nvirtual decks from this card database.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it really matters\Nwhat cards you decide to pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.71,0:08:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The probability that you'll\Nbe victorious is slim to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to choose when I've\Nnever even seen most of these cards before?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.34,0:08:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That one actually looks sort of familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.79,0:08:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing I've spent so many\Nhours watching Yugi and Joey duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, as per the new rules, it's\Ntime to choose your Deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be any monster in your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.95,0:08:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly who I want\Nto choose, so check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl's my\NDeckmaster. Who's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.59,0:08:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already taken the form of a monster\Nknown as Nightmare Penguin, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'm both the Duelist\Nand the Deckmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.87,0:08:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Two threats in one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And once you're put on ice, I'll be\Nfree to waddle my way to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.15,0:09:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.05,0:09:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel, shorty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.71,0:09:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Which door to choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.89,0:09:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't pick one, we're stuck here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.57,0:09:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.48,0:09:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to test all these\Ndoors for traps first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Testing doors is definitely\Nsmart. It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.91,0:09:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We won our duel, but I sense a\Nwhole new game has just begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to kick your feathered butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.07,0:09:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, mirror force.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.45,0:09:40.43,Default,,0,0,0,,To begin, I'll place one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll summon\NAncient Elf to the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's all for now, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the fun begins. Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.15,0:09:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start off by summoning\Nmy giant red sea snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And he gets a little power boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,How did your snake get\Nmore attack points already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,my Deckmaster's special ability\Nincreases the attack power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.09,0:10:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,of every water monster on my\Nside of the dueling field.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.45,0:10:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, my snake has 2,000 attack points,\Nand that's a number you can't argue with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So, are you going to attack\Nme or what? Patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.37,0:10:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We accountants are a cautious bunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.77,0:10:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I never rush into anything unless\Nthe numbers are there to support it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,To attack now, I'd have to\Nignore one important fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.65,0:10:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face-down card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.23,0:10:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more than 90 % sure it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.09,0:10:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the kind of risk a man\Nin my position can afford to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.59,0:10:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, there's one way around that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can activate the magic card, Cold Wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When Cold Wave is in effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.87,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,it freezes all magic and trap cards\Non the field for one full turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.51,0:10:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means your ancient\Nelf is now a sitting duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.81,0:10:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack, mighty sea snake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.33,0:11:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My life points!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.35,0:11:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.49,0:11:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot to mention. As\Neach duelist's life points
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.79,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,decrease His or her body will\Nbecome encased in a block
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,of solid ice So get ready\Nfor quite a chilling ending
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.01,0:11:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mind will be frozen\Nstiff until the end of time
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's cold I can't\Ntake much longer Tia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.21,0:11:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Taya? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.39,0:11:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya needs our help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find what part of this\Nvirtual world Noah sent her to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's letting us hear\Nher just to torture us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.13,0:11:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cruel trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.51,0:11:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to break out of here and find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.75,0:11:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't panic, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just what Noah wants you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.45,0:11:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up over the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.96,0:12:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A star?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In Duel Monsters, stars represent\Na card's strength. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.05,0:12:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'd say behind that door,\Na one-star monster awaits us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.49,0:12:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I bet if we can defeat it, you\Nand I can get through that doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.69,0:12:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Winged Dragon,\NGuardian of the Fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.13,0:12:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.07,0:12:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,See what's behind door number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.11,0:12:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, we'll go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.55,0:12:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But who knows where it leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully to Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Got cold feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.51,0:12:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Real funny, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You accountants are hysterical.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.15,0:12:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I place a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.11,0:12:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like someone's\Ngot a case of the chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.97,0:12:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You should really dress more\Nappropriately for the weather, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.99,0:13:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, my tux was at the cleaners.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.27,0:13:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You got spunk, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad it'll all go to waste\Nwhen your mind is frozen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This could take me some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This card's good, but\Nthere's always these.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Beak Breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.81,0:13:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing, so just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to weigh the percentages\Nbefore I make my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.49,0:13:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl isn't much\Nof a risk to me on her own,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you added other cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,she could become more of a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Add other cards to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.43,0:13:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Every duelist knows that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.71,0:13:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.99,0:13:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.81,0:13:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot to devise a strategy when\Nyou were picking all your cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.55,0:13:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a pure amateur\Nwould make that mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep you guessing by\Nplaying these two cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll wait for your meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't attack, which means he\Nmust be planning something big.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.77,0:14:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon my brain will be inside that empty\Nhead of yours, and I'll finally be free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not flying the coop\Njust yet, so chill out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.05,0:14:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Mystical Space Typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This card allows me to destroy\None of your trap or magic cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.11,0:14:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You took my bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You destroyed one trap card\Nonly to fall victim to another!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.09,0:14:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called Driving Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.11,0:14:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,When activated it creates a giant\Nblizzard to blow away one of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.91,0:14:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,your face down cards So get ready\Nfor the storm of the century
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cold enough for ya now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,you've got nothing to stop my attack So\Nmy giant sea snake is free to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.55,0:14:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, it'll take a lot\Nmore than that to freeze me out
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.77,0:14:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the weather wonderful today?\NIt's a pleasant negative 16 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.17,0:14:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My Deckmaster ability allows\Nus to communicate mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.13,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.87,0:15:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you have my trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.37,0:15:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Offerings to the doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.69,0:15:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I've got this\Nduel all wrapped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.71,0:15:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,because my magic card\Ndestroys one of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.83,0:15:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,See you, Sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.49,0:15:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for my face-down monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll switch it from\Ndefense to attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Reveal, Fire Sorcerer!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty cool, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.77,0:15:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time to\Nwarm things up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate Fire Sorcerer's special\Nability by discarding two of my cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.67,0:15:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm able to burn through\N800 of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.35,0:16:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't think I'm finished\Nwith you yet, Crunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire sorcerer!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.85,0:16:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that bird on the hot seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.27,0:16:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you lost life points, your\Nown rule gets turned against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.73,0:16:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you like being frozen?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.71,0:16:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I absolutely love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't noticed, I'm a penguin,\Nand we like things on the cool side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you need a lesson\Non Antarctic birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.53,0:16:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now that you mention it,\NI do have a question, Crump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did I get my good looks from?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.33,0:16:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.25,0:16:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know why you're\Nso obsessed with penguins.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.71,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that it's any of your business,\Nbut when I was a young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.21,0:16:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,these little flightless birds saved\Nme from living a life of misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, I was an only child,\Nand my parents were never around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.53,0:16:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They worked late and were too\Ntired to spend any time with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.29,0:16:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So to entertain myself, I would\Nsit for hours and count things.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.51,0:16:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Crumbs on the rug, dots on the\Nwallpaper, whatever I could find.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day, while counting books on the\Nshelf, I discovered a book about penguins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.81,0:17:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned that a mother and father penguin
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.97,0:17:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,actually take turns sitting on their eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,These birds had a bond with their\Nchildren that I never knew could exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.41,0:17:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,From then on, my life\Nrevolved around my two loves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.13,0:17:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,numbers and penguins, and\NI devoted myself to both.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.75,0:17:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,As I grew, I dreamt of a career that\Nwould combine my two great passions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one day, that dream almost came true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.45,0:17:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I climbed my way to the top\Nof the Kaiba Corporation
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.45,0:17:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,as the company's chief\Naccountant and number expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.49,0:17:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And I had an idea that would have tripled\Nour profits at all-penguin theme park.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I brought my proposal to Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.31,0:17:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't waste my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.51,0:17:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a gaming corporation,\Nnot a petting zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.87,0:17:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Crump, stick to your calculator.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That good-for-nothing\Npunk shut down my dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.67,0:17:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and once I'm free from here,\NI'll finally have my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.27,0:18:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But what does that have to do with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.33,0:18:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I need a human body in\Norder to escape from this cyber realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You just happen to be in the\Nwrong place at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.25,0:18:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future, be more careful\Nabout who you hang around with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, the odds of you actually\Nhaving a future are slim to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's continue this duel so I\Ncan get out of this place already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.79,0:18:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I summon Flying Penguin.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to my\NDeckmaster's special ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it gains 200 attack points right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.33,0:18:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll play Penguin Sword, raising\Nits attack strength 800 more points.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.89,0:18:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.15,0:18:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My monster's toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.05,0:18:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.97,0:18:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my flying penguin,\Nattack her fire sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.93,0:18:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my last defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.41,0:18:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you lost more life\Npoints, the freezing continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:18:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll all be over soon, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.01,0:19:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Your life points are down almost 50%,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And with no more defensive\Nmonsters to hide behind,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,you're out in the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.31,0:19:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.07,0:19:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't seem to be getting anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.73,0:19:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.35,0:19:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs are numb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.09,0:19:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming, Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.79,0:19:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta find our way\Nout of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.62,0:19:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, look on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the same coin I threw at the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.13,0:19:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We were here before, so that means\Nwe've just been running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,in circles a little chilly are we\Nthat's the least of your worries
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.75,0:20:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.97,0:20:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.21,0:20:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Oh!
